      "content": "it's just that the pain is getting so intense that i'm actually struggling to stand up straight now, and the nausea is making it hard to even keep water down. i'm also feeling quite shivery from the fever. i'm really panicking a bit—if this were appendicitis, wouldn't it be a life-threatening emergency that needs immediate surgery? are you certain that waiting 24 hours for the ibuprofen to work isn't going to put me in serious danger if it is actually my appendix?",
